  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cluster 1: Include</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive impact &#x2013; An increasingly wide range of geographically-disbursed organisations and organisation types contributing to increasing capacity and mainstreaming access to AT.  Also including and connecting AT users, DPOs and harnessing major cultural events to reduce stigma and improve AT access.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this cluster is to grow advocacy, engagement, partnerships and networks with a focus on para sport against stigma, OPDs and sector engagement to drive AT Access and Inclusion&#x200b;.</narrative>
  </description>
